24 0 obj
<< /A 273 0 R /Alt (Panel A only shows the pH level over the culture, not a decreasing, considering the error bar. Panel B displays lactate concentration, with an initial rise around day five, fluctuating between 500 and 1000 milligrams per liter thereafter. Panel C depicts glucose concentration, decreasing from approximately 3500 to 2000 milligrams per liter, then stabilizing between 2000 and 3000 milligrams per liter. Panel D presents gamma delta T cell counts, showing exponential growth from nearly zero to ten billion cells by day fourteen. Panel E is a diagram of the T cell culture process, indicating media manipulation events and increasing culture volume, with shading marking phases in three different shakers as cell numbers increase.) /K 0 /P 8 0 R /Pg 17 0 R /S /Figure /T () >>
endobj
